ight controls are on-screen.\nD1 cathode (bar) to 5V; anode to switched buzzer negative.\nVerify Q1 E/B/C pinout and buzzer current before assembly." (at 25.4 153.67 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5b985826-7ad4-484f-a361-41f4298da254"))(text "ALERT DRIVER" (at 132.08 108 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0242df69-8bfd-44a4-a8ed-ac8f77224d79"))(text "No custom PCB or Gerbers. See wiring.csv and production/BUILD.md." (at 25.4 184.15 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8951e5c2-c0e3-4a2b-9bda-b70679c8ee95")) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))) (embedded_fonts no))